    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always had a strong connection with mathematics, especially physics and maths, which I studied at upper secondary level. I use math daily in my self-employed work, like calculating costs and managing time. My parents’ educational background—especially my father’s PhD—helped shape my interest. I find it practical and logical, even if it’s not my favorite subject.",
