    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools like chatbots and math-solving apps last year. I input problems and got step-by-step explanations. It helped me understand concepts I struggled with, like derivatives. The experience was positive—clear, fast, and accessible. I didn’t rely on it fully, but it was a useful supplement to my learning.",
